# MAP HOLDING — Vercel deployment exclusions.
#
# Defense-in-depth for requirement: the local development agent environment
# must NEVER ship to production. These patterns exclude, for `vercel` CLI
# uploads, anything that is (a) already covered by .gitignore or (b) a local
# build artifact that must not be re-deployed as source.

# Local development agent service (dev-only sign-in page, session server,
# synthetic .local roster, dev env with credentials)
worker/local/local.env
worker/local/dev-users.json
public/agent-config.local.json

# Build artifacts — never deploy a local out/ as the site (a local out/
# contains the dev-only agent-config.local.json override)
out
.next

# Wrangler config is for the standalone worker; not part of the Vercel site
wrangler.json
.wrangler
